text:
@jeremy_pm 💔 Fragile pregnancy. Weak body. Ongoing bleeding.
Every day feels more dangerous than the one before. My body is exhausted, my immunity is low, and I live in constant fear for the tiny life growing inside me.
I am not asking for much… €50 for vitamins, food, and treatment could […]

@rogueresistknitter.bsky.social knew I wanted a Liam's "Conejo" hat, so she took the only janky pattern she could find, forced it into submission, and crocheted me one. 

I've never had a better hat. This one's for you, Liam. 💕🐇🐇🐇

(She crocheted squeakies into the dangly paws.)
